: 28772549, 'prompt_eval_count': 560, 'prompt_eval_duration': 595410851, 'eval_count': 624, 'eval_duration': 15844627696, 'model_name': 'codestral:22b'} id='run--63a49702-2b4a-4171-8025-057d9c7693d5-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 560, 'output_tokens': 624, 'total_tokens': 1184}
