Task 1: Import assert.yml  
Description Task 1: Import assertion tasks from assert.yml to validate logrotate setup.  

Task 2: Install logrotate  
Description Task 2: Install logrotate package using the package name specified in logrotate_packages variable.  

Task 3: Configure logrotate  
Description Task 3: Configure logrotate by templating the configuration file from logrotate_config_file.j2 to the specified directory.  

Task 4: Generate logrotate.d files  
Description Task 4: Generate logrotate.d configuration files using templates for each entry in logrotate_entries, skipping entries marked as absent.  

Task 5: Remove logrotate.d files  
Description Task 5: Remove logrotate.d files for entries marked as absent in logrotate_entries.  

